格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Claude Code-style terminal UI for DeepSeek Harness agents, as an out-of-tree dsh plugin bundle","id":"gh:1333234252","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-tui","slug":"dsh-tui/dsh-tui","topics":["agent","claude-code","cli","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","terminal","tui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Claude Code-style terminal UI for DeepSeek Harness agents, as an out-of-tree dsh plugin bundle"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @dsh-tui/dsh-tui"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An interactive terminal (TUI) front door for DeepSeek Harness agents — a Claude Code / Codex-style c"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"hat interface in your terminal, installed as an out-of-tree dsh plugin bundle. Built on `@earendil-w"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" in your terminal, installed as an out-of-tree dsh plugin bundle. Built on `@earendil-works/pi-tui`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It composes over the official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-base` bundle, so the whole plugin ecosystem — shell "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"and filesystem tools, skills, subagents, workflows, sandbox approvals — is the same one the official"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" web surface uses. Nothing is forked."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Streaming model output and reasoning, rendered as Markdown\n- Tool-call cards with terminal / diff "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"/ generic render intents; Ctrl+O cycles collapsed → expanded → hidden\n- Approval and `ask_user_quest"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ion` dialogs, plan-mode review included\n- `@file` path autocomplete and `@session` reference cards\n-"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" Slash commands: `/model` (with reasoning-effort selection), `/resume`, `/compact`, `/details`, `/he"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"lp`, and every command other plugins register\n- Standing todo panel, token usage and context-pressur"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"e status line, session titles\n- Configurable theme; truecolor detected from `COLORTERM`"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Requires Node `^22.19 || >=24` and the `dsh` CLI (`npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh@next`)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"To track the repo instead of the npm release, use `add github:dsh-tui/dsh-tui`. Git-hosted plugins b"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"uild on install via their `prepare` script, which pnpm blocks until you allow it: if that `add` fail"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"s, append the key it prints under `allowBuilds` in `~/.dsh/profiles/tui/pnpm-workspace.yaml` and re-"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"pend the key it prints under `allowBuilds` in `~/.dsh/profiles/tui/pnpm-workspace.yaml` and re-run —"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Set `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` in your environment (or a `.env` in the launch directory or `$DSH_HOME`)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Local / self-hosted DeepSeek endpoints"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"No code changes needed — pick one:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. **Environment**: `DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1` alongside `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`.\n2. **"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"Settings (hot-reloaded)**: `$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml`"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"3. **OpenAI-compatible gateways** (vLLM, SGLang, …): declare an `llm-pi-ai` route in your profile pa"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"tch (`$DSH_HOME/profiles/tui/cordis.patch.yml`) and point the default model at it — see the dsh prov"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"OME/profiles/tui/cordis.patch.yml`) and point the default model at it — see the dsh providers guide."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"pi-tui is pinned at 0.80.7 with a pnpm patch (editor prompt prefixes) and bundled into `lib/` so ins"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"talls outside this repo never see an unpatched copy."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Status and known limitations"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Under active development against the pre-release `@deepseek-ai/dsh` rc line; expect breakage until"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" upstream stabilizes. Peer dependencies pin the tested rc.\n- The recovered test suite (`tests/`) pre"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"dates the port and does not run yet.\n- A real model turn requires a reachable DeepSeek-compatible en"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"dpoint; everything up to the request (composition, rendering, approvals, resume) works keyless."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Provenance and license"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT. The TUI implementation was recovered from the DeepSeek Harness repository history (`packages/ui"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"/tui`, removed upstream in commit `10bb9cbf4a`) and ported to the published rc API; upstream copyrig"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ht is preserved in LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
